        "created_at": "2013-05-15T14:58:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've been looking through the GSF Kickstarter updates, announcements, comments, as well as the forum posts here and I've been unable to find the following information: how much money do I need to add to my pledge to receive an additional copy of GSF? Normally I would just message the creators directly but I haven't heard word back yet and there is only 1 day left to the Kickstarter project. Is this something any of you all know?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Big thanks in advance. I'm very excited about this game and really look forward to getting my hands on it come October.</p>",
